  "text": "proprium.sancti-marci-evangelistae-introitus",
  "about": "The introitus of the formulary “Saint Mark the Evangelist” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Thou hast protected me from the assembly of the malignant, alleluia: from the multitude of the workers of iniquity, allelúja, allelúja. Hear, O God, my prayer, when I make supplication to Thee: deliver my soul from the fear of the enemy. Glory be to the Father, and to the Son, and to the Holy Ghost. As it was in the beginning, is now, and ever shall be, world without end. Amen. Thou hast protected me from the assembly of the malignant, alleluia: from the multitude of the workers of iniquity. allelúja, allelúja." }
  },
